      "message": "Ray,\nFrame in audio is `samples * number of channels`.\n\nThis is a bit confusing especially when looking at it from a video codec perseptive where a frame is what you decode or encode in a call.\n\nBut this is the terminology used for audio codecs.\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/media/java/android/media/MediaFormat.java;l\u003d920;drc\u003d1ba0be0c7a755dc016fa2bd95be2c0473dfac983",
